Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And here is the contrast examiners test.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.43,0:00:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If husband and wife are\Nboth Government servants
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,living in hired or owned\Naccommodation, both
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,draw House Rent Allowance as\Nper their own entitlement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.27,0:00:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That is completely\Ndifferent from the Paragraph
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,5.1 bar, where the spouse\Nhas been allotted Government
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.82,0:00:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,accommodation at the same station.
